; The arctic route (docs/story.md 4i "The arctic, as a route"; maps in data/maps/arctic*.json, docs/maps.md 9).
; The world map's landing in the far north (the snowy island at the top left of the minimap) appears once
; flag 381 is set: the post-game chapter sets it with the arctic explosion. Its minimap icon is the star
; while the quest is on (381 set, 382 clear) and the plain marker once 382 is set (Super 13 beaten, also
; the post-game chapter's to set).

; the landing: down to the foot of the mountain, onto the flight spot (zone 15 area 1)
script arc_wm_land
    WarpToMapWithEntities 15, 1, 1, 136, 264
    END
end
